）<MATH_0010>的等价类（equivalence class）看作<MATH_0011>。）\n<STRUCT_0007> 两个对（pairs）<MATH_0012>及<MATH_0013>称为等价的（equivalent），若存在第三个对（pair）<MATH_0014>，以及态射（morphisms）<MATH_0015>与<MATH_0016>，它们属于<MATH_0017>，并且嵌入交换图表（commutative diagram）\n<MATH_0018>。\n<STRUCT_0008> 下列两个对（pairs）的等价类（equivalence classes）的合成（composition）：<MATH_0019>及<MATH_0020>，定义为对（pair）<MATH_0021>的等价类（equivalence class），其中选取<MATH_0022>与<MATH_0023>使它们嵌入交换图表（commutative diagram）\n<MATH_0024>，\n该图表由假设存在。\n<STRUCT_0009> 恒等态射（identity morphism）<MATH_0025>（在<MATH_0026>中）是对（pair）<MATH_0027>的等价类（equivalence class）。\n<STRUCT_0010>\n\n", "translation_hash": "sha256:054484b6329e2a18a5ac50205d06e176cf6b675c09a3cba33a9361a3e6e1d183", "unit_id": "tag:04VB:prose-0002", "unknown_terms": [{"context": "所构造的局部化范畴；暂无批准项。", "source_term": "categories", "target_term": "范畴"}, {"context": "本段完整命名构造；暂定译法。", "source_term": "Left calculus of fractions", "target_term": "左分式演算"}, {"context": "原范畴及新范畴；暂无批准项。", "source_term": "category", "target_term": "范畴"}, {"context": "系统满足左乘性条件；暂定译法。", "source_term": "left multiplicative", "target_term": "左乘性的"}, {"context": "给定的左乘性系统；暂无批准项。", "source_term": "system", "target_term": "系统"}, {"context": "局部化范畴的态射；暂无批准项。", "source_term": "Morphisms", "target_term": "态射"}, {"context": "代表分式的有序对；暂定译法。", "source_term": "pairs", "target_term": "对"}, {"context": "这些对上的等价；暂无批准项。", "source_term": "equivalence", "target_term": "等价"}, {"context": "单个分式的等价类；暂无批准项。", "source_term": "equivalence class", "target_term": "等价类"}, {"context": "单个分式代表对；暂定译法。", "source_term": "pair", "target_term": "对"}, {"context": "两个代表对的等价条件；暂无批准项。", "source_term": "equivalent", "target_term": "等价的"}, {"context": "见证两个代表对等价的态射；暂无批准项。", "source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射"}, {"context": "等价与合成定义中的图表；暂无批准项。", "source_term": "commutative diagram", "target_term": "交换图表"}, {"context": "局部化态射的合成；暂无批准项。", "source_term": "composition", "target_term": "合成"}, {"context": "待合成的两个类；暂无批准项。", "source_term": "equivalence classes", "target_ter